{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 3, "text": "问：“你是从山路来还是从水路行？”", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 318, "w": 623, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "问：“你是从山路来还是从水路行？”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 318, "w": 623, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 4, "text": "答：“山路也走，水路也行。”", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 386, "w": 478, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "答：“山路也走，水路也行。”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 386, "w": 478, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 5, "text": "问：“山路有几十几个弯，水路有几十几个滩？”", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 447, "w": 804, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "问：“山路有几十几个弯，水路有几十几个滩？”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 447, "w": 804, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 6, "text": "答：“我从山路来，烟雾沉沉不见弯；水路行，水浪滔滔不见滩。”", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 515, "w": 1089, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "答：“我从山路来，烟雾沉沉不见弯；水路行，水浪滔滔不见滩。”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 515, "w": 1089, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 7, "text": "问：“你从山路来有何人把路口，从水路行有何人渡船？”", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 571, "w": 973, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "问：“你从山路来有何人把路口，从水路行有何人渡船？”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 571, "w": 973, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 8, "text": "答：“我从山路来有山神土地把路口，从水路行有水浒三官渡船。”", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 644, "w": 1134, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "答：“我从山路来有山神土地把路口，从水路行有水浒三官渡船。”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 644, "w": 1134, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 9, "text": "问：“是何人与你带路，何人与你来踩门？”", "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 708, "w": 720, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "问：“是何人与你带路，何人与你来踩门？”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 708, "w": 720, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 10, "text": "答：“八洞神仙来带路，魁星与我踩财门。人之初，性本善，开一扇，留一扇。孟子见", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 776, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "答：“八洞神仙来带路，魁星与我踩财门。人之初，性本善，开一扇，留一扇。孟子见", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 776, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 11, "text": "梁惠王，两扇打开又何妨。”", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 837, "w": 474, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "梁惠王，两扇打开又何妨。”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 837, "w": 474, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 12, "text": "七、迁新居", "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 905, "w": 185, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "七、迁新居", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 905, "w": 185, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 13, "text": "房子装修好以后，要择期迁新居。日期一般选择在农历的腊月，忌二、八月迁居。搬", "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 970, "w": 1459, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "房子装修好以后，要择期迁新居。日期一般选择在农历的腊月，忌二、八月迁居。搬", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 970, "w": 1459, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 14, "text": "家前要请先生安家神，用红纸书写神龛牌位贴在堂屋中间上方。一般写法为：中间是“天", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1034, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "家前要请先生安家神，用红纸书写神龛牌位贴在堂屋中间上方。一般写法为：中间是“天", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1034, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 15, "text": "地国亲师位”，两边是神位。一幅“敬天地天恩地厚，祀祖宗祖德流芳”的对联贴左右，横", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1098, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "地国亲师位”，两边是神位。一幅“敬天地天恩地厚，祀祖宗祖德流芳”的对联贴左右，横", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1098, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 16, "text": "额为“祖德流芳。”神龛下面是土地牌位，正中写“镇宅长生土地瑞庆夫人之神位”。在", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1163, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "额为“祖德流芳。”神龛下面是土地牌位，正中写“镇宅长生土地瑞庆夫人之神位”。在", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1163, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 17, "text": "“长”字右边写“安”字，左边写“妥”字，又在“安”、“妥”字顺下写“招财童子”，“进宝郎", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1227, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“长”字右边写“安”字，左边写“妥”字，又在“安”、“妥”字顺下写“招财童子”，“进宝郎", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1227, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 18, "text": "君”。土地牌位两边对联是“土产无价宝，地生有道财”。横额写“金玉满堂”。大门对联", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1291, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "君”。土地牌位两边对联是“土产无价宝，地生有道财”。横额写“金玉满堂”。大门对联", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1291, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 19, "text": "有“迁居正逢黄道日，进房正遇紫微星”，横额写“大吉大利”等。大小门对联和窗子对联", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1356, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有“迁居正逢黄道日，进房正遇紫微星”，横额写“大吉大利”等。大小门对联和窗子对联", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1356, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 20, "text": "一般都是“七言”或“五言”对，有新有古，各自选择。", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1420, "w": 897, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "一般都是“七言”或“五言”对，有新有古，各自选择。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1420, "w": 897, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 21, "text": "入宅的时辰都以当日的黄道时最佳。主人家要做好一甑饭，一桌菜，准备一挑水，用", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 1489, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "入宅的时辰都以当日的黄道时最佳。主人家要做好一甑饭，一桌菜，准备一挑水，用", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 1489, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 22, "text": "草包起火，良辰一到，帮忙的若干人一道背起饭，挑起水，包起火，拿起火炮蜡烛、厨房用", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1553, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "草包起火，良辰一到，帮忙的若干人一道背起饭，挑起水，包起火，拿起火炮蜡烛、厨房用", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1553, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 23, "text": "具及家具、粮食等搬到新房（表示人不管在什么地方住，都离不开金、木、水、火、土，到什", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1617, "w": 1544, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "具及家具、粮食等搬到新房（表示人不管在什么地方住，都离不开金、木、水、火、土，到什", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1617, "w": 1544, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 24, "text": "么地方都要把它们带走）。", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1678, "w": 458, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "么地方都要把它们带走）。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1678, "w": 458, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 25, "text": "进新房以后，将准备好的饭、菜、酒、筷摆在堂屋正中八仙桌上，除菜有8个外，需饭4", "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 1746, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "进新房以后，将准备好的饭、菜、酒、筷摆在堂屋正中八仙桌上，除菜有8个外，需饭4", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 1746, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 26, "text": "碗、酒4杯、筷4双分别搭配好，烧香九炷（神龛上面正中插3炷，两边分别各1炷，门前、", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1806, "w": 1552, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "碗、酒4杯、筷4双分别搭配好，烧香九炷（神龛上面正中插3炷，两边分别各1炷，门前、", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1806, "w": 1552, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 436, "line_no": 27, "text": "厨房、牛圈、神龛下面各1炷），焚烧纸钱敬供天、地、菩萨、祖宗（四杯酒、四碗饭、四双筷", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1875, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "厨房、牛圈、神龛下面各1炷），焚烧纸钱敬供天、地、菩萨、祖宗（四杯酒、四碗饭、四双筷", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1875, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
